cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ChemFlow-ED (the workflow, scripts, or example data),
  please cite both the accompanying manuscript and this software
  release.
type: software
title: ChemFlow-ED
abstract: >-
  ChemFlow-ED (Chemistry Flow for Education and Drug Discovery) is a
  modular, open-source computational workflow and companion Python
  script suite that lets students carry out authentic, ligand-independent
  structure-based drug discovery beginning from an experimentally
  determined protein structure alone.
